# .gecko/config — optional. Sourced by `gecko check` / `gecko baseline`
# only when this file is tracked (commit it).
#
# Define gecko_detect() to print findings, one per line, as:
#     <path><TAB><finding-key>
#
# Keys must be stable: no line numbers or columns, or every edit above a
# finding registers as a new one.
#
# If you do not define gecko_detect(), gecko uses its built-in annotation
# ratchet (comment-shaped `ponytail:` / `gecko:` markers). Zero config, any
# language.

